window.products.push({"id":1108029,"name":"Contigo Autoseal Sheridan Double Wall Insulated Travel Mug, 16-Ounce, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vAb8IvANL._AC_SL1039_.jpg","description":"Contigo AUTOSEAL Sheridan Travel Mug 16-ounce Capacity This double-walled 16-ounce travel mug features a patented AUTOSEAL lid, making it leak and spill proof, yet easy to use and hold. An added button lock provides even more security, by preventing accidental pressing of the AUTOSEAL button while on-the-go. This BPA-free mug fits most car cup-holders and single-serve brewers, and is top-rack dishwasher safe. Available in gunmetal, berry, and an assortment of additional colors. Bottle Features: Patented AUTOSEAL lid automatically seals between sips to prevent leaks and spills Patented AUTOSEAL lid automatically seals between sips to prevent leaks and spills Easy, one-handed use for convenient and safe drinking Easy, one-handed use for convenient and safe drinking Double-wall construction helps beverages retain their temperature and prevents external condensation Double-wall construction helps beverages retain their temperature and prevents external condensation Button lock prevents accidental pressing of button for added security while on-the-go Button lock prevents accidental pressing of button for added security while on-the-go Fully top-rack dishwasher-safe lid and body Fully top-rack dishwasher-safe lid and body BPA-free plastic BPA-free plastic Fits most standard car cup holders Fits most standard car cup holders Fits most single-serve brewers Fits most single-serve brewers Available in a variety of colors Available in a variety of colors 16 oz. capacity 16 oz. capacity AUTOSEAL Technology Automatically seals between sips The leak and spill proof AUTOSEAL lid automatically seals between sips, to eliminate leaks and spills. There is no lid to remove or spout to open, so it is great for one-handed, on-the-go drinking whether commuting, shopping, or just dealing with a busy day. Simply press the button to drink and then release to seal between sips. And because the lid system is always closed unless activated, your beverages will remain hotter or colder for longer periods of time. Double-wall Construction Retains temperature and prevents condensation With its double-wall construction, this fun travel mug works to ensure that hot beverages stay hot and cool beverages stay cool. The double-wall design not only retains temperature, but also prevents external condensation from forming so table tops remain free from moisture. Environmentally friendly By using this Contigo product, you're both helping the environment and also saving money by taking your coffee, tea, water or juice with you in a reusable container instead of buying cups or water bottles as you go. Research shows that coffee drinkers can save nearly 23 pounds of paper cup waste by toting around their own reusable mug. Easy Slide-lock Feature Prevents accidental pressing of button An added button-lock feature provides even more on-the-go security, by preventing any unintended pressing of the button. You’ll have extra confidence as you go about your daily routine, knowing your drink is fully sealed inside. Top-rack dishwasher safe This stylish 16-ounce Contigo travel mug is fully top-rack dishwasher safe for fast and easy cleaning at home. Caring for Your Contigo For easy care, this product is fully top-rack dishwasher safe. Always rinse the mug immediately after each use, and always store the mug with its lid removed to prevent moisture from becoming trapped in the body or lid after washing. Do not keep liquids that spoil easily, such as dairy, in the mug for prolonged periods. For use with hot or cold beverages. About Contigo Knowing that on-the-go beverages can be messy and complicated to use, Contigo developed a line of simple, yet functionally innovative drinkware to help people face life's daily challenges. The products are stylish yet resilient; sleek yet strong – the perfect combination of performance and grace. Contigo products give you the confidence you need to face the day, and pride in knowing that you bought the best of the best. Contigo is passionate about the products they create and believes you will be pleasantly surprised by the array of helpful innovations it offers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vAb8IvANL._AC_SL1039_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Contigo","source_asin":"B00C5D1EI2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C5D1EI2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C5D1EI2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
