window.products.push({"id":1108065,"name":"NOLTSE 10W Portable Air Conditioner 70°Oscillating Evaporative Cooler with 4 Speeds Rainbow LED Light, 2 Spray Humidify & 2-6H Timer, 600ml 35dB Quiet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xkMYk2OZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WANT TO STAY COOL AND FRESH ON A HOT, SWEATY SUMMER DAY? ❅Our portable air conditioner fans save you money and blow cool wind, keep your skin hydrated and enjoy fresh air, quiet and easy to carry. ❅Powerful, compact, portable air cooler with 4 levels of wind, 2 humidification holes and 70° oscillating; to fill any space with cool, clean, comfortable air! It uses the same ultrasonic atomizer and nano-spray technology as the face steamer to effectively reduce dryness. ENJOY COOL, CLEAN AIR WITH OUR PORTABLE AIR CONDITIONER! ❄4 in 1, it is not only a personal air cooler, but also a desk fan, air humidifier, LED night light. ❄ 4 adjustable speeds ❄ 2 humidification holes, effectively reduce dryness and replenish moisture. ❄2-6H Timer, helps reduce electricity bills ❄70°oscillating function to expand the cooling area ❄Portable carrying handle, suitable for outdoor activities, camping, parties ❄Super quiet and rainbow night light to help with sleep ❄Top 600ml extra large water tank and bottom water pan ❄1.5m usb cable, it can be connected to adapters, power banks, computers, car chargers.   NOTE: 1. Please note that this is a personal space air conditioner fan and cannot cool the entire room. That means you'd better keep it close by. 2. The personal air cooler will only work properly with an adapter above 5V 2A (the kit does not include the adapter). 3. The maximum capacity of the water tank is 600ML, it is best to add 3/4 water to the water tank, do not fill it up. 4. If you want to enjoy cooler wind, you can add ice water and ice cubes to the tank.   THE PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 x Personal Air Conditioning Fan 1 x USB cable 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xkMYk2OZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOLTSE","source_asin":"B09WV9RVSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WV9RVSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WV9RVSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108066,"name":"Almcmy 12 Inch Cast Iron Skillet, Pre-Seasoned Frying Pan with Silicone Handle Holder, Cast Iron Pan for Frying Grilling, Oven Safe, Dishwasher Safe -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818Rt3H7rFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥦【Quality Cast Iron Skillet】The whole pan is made of high-quality cast iron, with very few impurities, strong and stable, and not easy to break. Excellent thermal conductivity distributes heat evenly throughout the cast iron pan, allowing heat to be quickly transferred to the food and less likely to stick to the pan, making your cooking process easier. Note: Do not use dishwashers, steel wool, or acidic cleaners when cleaning cast iron pans, as this may damage the rust-resistant coating. 🥩【Big Size & Enough Weight】The diameter of the cast iron pan is 30cm (12inch), and the large-capacity pan allows you to cook more food at one time, enough to meet the needs of multiple people. And the weight of the pot is 3.2kg (7.05 pounds), so that the whole cast iron pot will not easily shake and shift during use, and you don't have to worry about being easily knocked down when using it outdoors, you can use it with confidence. 🧀【Pre-Seasoned】The whole cast iron pan is pre-seasoned with vegetable oil, you can use it directly. In the subsequent use process, you can re-season the cast iron pot from time to time. Effective maintenance can make the cast iron pot last longer. After cleaning the cast iron pot, please wipe off the residual water on the pot body, or reheat it until the water evaporates, and in doing so, the possibility of rusting is largely avoided. 🥓【Safe& Convenient Design】Cast iron pans have handles on the rim that help you lift heavy pans filled with food. At the same time, there are side drip spouts on both ends of the pot, don't worry about spilling the soup on the table. In addition, we are also equipped with a silicone handle cover to help you use the cast iron pan better, without worrying about being scalded by the hot cast iron pan. Please do not put the handle cover into the oven, please pay attention to safety when using. 🥘【Super applicability】A good pot must be able to be used for every occasion. Whether it is induction cooker, gas, oven, you can use this cast iron pan. At the same time, you can also use this pan directly when grilling outdoors. The effective distribution and retention of heat is the biggest advantage of this cast iron pan, and you can easily cook delicious dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818Rt3H7rFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Almcmy","source_asin":"B0B8MMS813","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8MMS813","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8MMS813","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
