window.products.push({"id":1108248,"name":"Robot Vacuum and Mop, Robotic Vacuum Cleaner, 2 in 1 Mopping Robot Vacuum Cleaner with 230ML Water Tank, Self-Charging, Super-Thin, Multiple Cleaning ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UgiIYkPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Four Efficient Cleaning Modes】: The BR150 robot vacuum and mop combo is not only capable of vacuuming and mopping but also has a variety of intelligent cleaning modes to meet your daily cleaning needs. Maximum area coverage, less missed scanning, and improves cleaning efficiency by 30%. 【2-In-1 Mopping Robot Vacuum】：Want to free your hands from heavy housework?Why not try a hybrid robot vacuum which combines vacuuming and mopping? BR150 mopping robot vacuum comes standard with a 200ml dustbin and a 230ml water tank. Ideal for vacuuming and mopping hardwood, tile, and stone floors, so you can enjoy more family time. 【Advantaged Brushless Suction Port-No Hair Entanglement Any More】: This robotic vacuum cleaner powered by strong digital motor. BR150 robot vacuum has strong suction power and unique air inlet design,which will not be blocked by pet hair like other robot vacuum cleaners with roller brushes. 【Intelligent Obstacle Avoidance Upgraded Again】: The BR150 Robot Vacuum Cleaner has advanced 3D precise obstacle avoidance function, A full set of sensors let the robotic vacuum avoid accidental falls and reduces bumping while cleaning.With a 2.91'' super slim body, the BR150 robot vacuum cleaner reaches every corner and narrow area with ease and keeps your floor clean and fresh. 【100mins Runtime & Self-charging】: Both mopping and vacuuming offers two levels of intensity adjustment, adjustable for different floor types. With 2500mAh battery capacity, BR150 robotic vacuum can continuously work 100min in a 1290sqft house. BR150 robot vacuum cleaner will automatically back to the charging base and recharge when in low battery or finished cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UgiIYkPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GTTVO Robot","source_asin":"B09BN9VMT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BN9VMT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BN9VMT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
