window.products.push({"id":1108373,"name":"favonian Anchor Fabric Shower Curtain for Bathroom, Nautical Themed Hotel Quality Bath Curtain Set with Hooks, 72x72 Inch (Colorful)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91B2y6SD10S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[WIDELY APPLICATION]: Features a print of anchor pattern, which is originally designed by our artist. This rustic nautical design can be widely used for bathroom, campers, motels, hotels, dorms and more. Moreover, the curtain not only used as a shower curtain, but also a standalone curtain. [PREMIUM QUALITY]: Made of premium polyester fabric, serves healthy and long life use; 120 GSM weighted fabric retains its shape and not to be blown up, extremely strong and durable. A total of 12 rust-resistant metal grommets along reinforced top-header fits the sturdy hooks well, which ensures a long-time using. [WATERPROOF AND PRIVACY]: Water-repellent coating is treated to let water bead stay on the surface, quick to repel and dry. The extra blackout coating perfectly solves the problem of transparency, offers a better privacy protection and avoid embarrassment. [EASY INSTALLATION AND CARE]: Simply equipped with the hooks for easy installation without any effort. Machine washable or washing in cold water, do not bleach or tumble dry. Cool iron if needed. [PACKAGE UPGRADE ]: We upgrade the outer packaging and the hook packaging, upgraded packaging makes the shower curtain not only bathroom decor but also a great gift to your friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91B2y6SD10S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"favonian","source_asin":"B09QGJ6C4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QGJ6C4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QGJ6C4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108374,"name":"Crafthouse by Fortessa Professional Barware by Charles Joly Stainless Steel and Glass Smoking Box with Handheld Smoker for Cocktail/Beverage/Cheese/Fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813ejMO6Y0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crafthouse by Fortessa is a comprehensive barware collection for the aspiring home mixologist, designed by world champion bartender, Charles Jolly Charles has applied his bartending ethos to the broad line of tools and glassware to bring the authentic cocktail experience home. Inspired by prohibition-era barware and updated with contemporary ergonomic principles, Crafthouse by Fortessa provides all the tools to create professional grade cocktails at home. Each piece is designed from the golden age of cocktails and the streamlined simplicity of Deco architecture. Charles Jolly is a James beard award winner and a lifelong food and beverage professional. The chicago-native is a certified mixologist who focuses on a balance between the classics and his own seasonal original cocktails. With a strong emphasis on knowing the roots of the craft along with a progressive vision for the future every feature is purposeful and every detail functional. Entertain like a world class bartender with Crafthouse by Fortessa. The double-sided \"pass through\" doors on this smoking box makes for a dramatic, interactive cocktail experience. You can experiment with various types of woods, dried herbs, and spices and it's even great for smoking your favorite foods! this smoking box comes with a hand held smoker and smoking chips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813ejMO6Y0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crafthouse by Fortessa","source_asin":"B097ND3JT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097ND3JT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097ND3JT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
