window.products.push({"id":1108435,"name":"Avocado Slicer, ONEKOO Multifunction Avocado Cutter, For the Avocado Fruit Cuts, Pits, Peeled, Premium Stainless Steel, With Fruit Fork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sAdL0c-lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: Premium Stainless steel. Size: 5.9 x 2.36 x 0.28 Inch Weight：47g Features: All-in-One! You get three times the amount of tools,all for one price Serrated metallic sharp edge means easy cutting, andsafe to the touch! Use Instructions: Cut Cut Ensure that your avocado is ripe by pressing onthe skin - the avocado should slightly give with pressure. Using a sharp knife,slice your avocado in half, lengthwise. Remove the Pits Remove the Pits Place the cutter pointed end around the pit. With a gentle motion remove the pit. ( !! Don'tthrow away the pit - it can help prevent your guacamole from turning brown) Take out the Fruit Flesh Take out the Fruit Flesh Position the slicer over the larger end of theavocado. With light pressure, insert the slicer into the fruit and pull towardsyou, slicing through and scooping the fruit from theskin. Tips: 1、 Can’t tell if your avocado is ripe? Take the small brown stemoff the top of the avocado. If it comes off easily and you can see golden, underneaththe stem, the avocado is ripe! If the stem doesn't come off or if you seegreen, the avocado is not ripe. 2、 Put avocado in a paper bag with a banana, the ethylene gasfrom the banana will help speed up the ripening process. Our 100% “BE AMAZED” Satisfactionservice We stand behind ourproducts. We know that once you use our items, you’ll be amazed at its strengthand simplicity. If you’re not, just send itback, and we’ll gladly provide you a “don’t-ask-me-any-questions” refund. Product Include: 1 х Avocado Slicer 2 х Fruit Fork","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sAdL0c-lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONEKOO","source_asin":"B082CHMLHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082CHMLHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082CHMLHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
