window.products.push({"id":1108479,"name":"NOVICA Reverse Painted Wood and Glass Wall Mounted Mirror, Brown, Song of Spring'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813rWhLIVrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: Asunta Pelaez evokes the golden sun of springtime and the song of birds in the late afternoon. Delicately painted by hand, bright flowers appear everywhere in this extravagant wall mirror. Its graceful lines and golden borders are sensuous and elegant. Frame: 23.5\" H x 19.75\" W x 0.8\" D Mirror: 9.75\" W x 13.0\" HAbout our Artist: Asunta Pelaez tells her story: 'At first my husband's family taught me, then we united our skills and labor. I realized that the more I practiced, the more this craft won me over, offering me tremendous gratification. Now I consider it a way of life. This whole process demands incredible patience and attention to detail. My designs are inspired by nature, and by traditional scenes from my town and region. I feel very proud of the works that I create.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813rWhLIVrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0057Y7322","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057Y7322","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057Y7322","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
