window.products.push({"id":1108674,"name":"HomePop Leatherette Storage Bench Settee with Hinged Lid, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31LhkppDOtL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add storage and seating to your living space with this stately storage bench from kinfine. The rich, medium-brown color coordinates well with most decor and gives your space a traditional look. Lift up the seat to reveal the perfect storage spot for magazines, toys and more. The seat itself is plush and comfortable, making this storage bench a favorite for reading sessions and relaxing afternoons. The light cherry wood finished legs are not only a good contrast with the chocolate brown bench, but also provides a sturdy foundation. Assembly required. Dimensions 55\"L x 19.5\"W x 24.5\"H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31LhkppDOtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomePop","source_asin":"B08FYZCSPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FYZCSPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FYZCSPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108675,"name":"Art Poster Print - The Fairy Tale - Artist: Walter Firle- Poster Size: 23 X 28","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413KRH6SP6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Walter Firle:The Fairy Tale 23 X 28 inches. High Quality Art Work. Browse our store for framed and unframed posters and shop for all your art needs at DirectForSale. This The Fairy Tale is made with High Quality Poster paper and is made for years of enjoy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413KRH6SP6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"directforsale","source_asin":"B000IK8IFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IK8IFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IK8IFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108676,"name":"SALE! Double Wall Glasses 8 oz – Great For Coffee, wine, beer, whiskey, Or Any Hot Or Cold Drinks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hU5mqE0SL._AC_SL1056_.jpg","description":"You can never have enough of quality glassware for your home, especially when it is double-wall glasses – not only do they look great, but they are multi-functional! Main Features of Double Wall Glasses Made using borosilicate glass Ordinary glasses contain a mix of quartz, sodium carbonate and calcium carbonate, while borosilicate adds boron to the composition. It helps to strengthen the glass and make it extremely lightweight, also rendering it heat-resistant – with quality better than traditional glass. It is blown by sophisticated techniques that are responsible for its toughness. Sturdy and robust structure This type of glassware is resistant to scratches, chips, and nicks with a lower percentage of breakage than single wall glasses due to the powerful borosilicate glass utilized during manufacture. These glasses are dishwasher safe, and since their thermal resistance capacity is quite high, they are unaffected by microwave heat as well. You could also store them in the freezer safely, without cracking or breaking. Great stability The glasses have superior stability so they can be used for both hot and cold beverages –from a fancy frozen dessert to hot coffee. The insulation is excellent, so it retains both hot and cold temperatures for a very long time. Moreover, the glass doesn’t get cloudy or murky with time, unlike its conventional counterparts. Everyday use These glasses look exquisite and fancy, but can be used on a daily basis. The insulation properties ensures that heat or cold can’t penetrate through the walls, so you won’t feel the temperature against your palm which is a great added benefit for kids. Perfect Gift The next time you wrack your brains trying to come up with a great present, just buy a set of double wall glasses – they will surely appreciate this practical gift. So, what are you waiting for? Please place your order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hU5mqE0SL._AC_SL1056_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchsmart","source_asin":"B01D8VCTQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D8VCTQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D8VCTQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
