window.products.push({"id":1108715,"name":"Joherad Neck Pillows for Pain Relief Sleeping, Side Sleeper Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain, Ergonomic Orthopedic Cervical Pillow with Contour Memor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gkSzNXscL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】The ergonomic orthopedic pillow combines a neck roll pillow and a contour pillow, suitable for various sleeping positions.Ergonomic design with special butterfly shape,the pillow holds the head correct in sleeping positions.the concave area in the center will not press your ears and the butterfly-shaped design allows your arms to have a place to rest.It will take you a few days to get used to your new pillow. Of course it will be your best pillow. 💤【Two Heights for Meet Your Need】The size of cervical neck pillow is 24.80*15.35*3.74/5.12 inch.This cervical pillow are designed in two layers to support your head and arms.you can use it to neck pain relief.This pillow is ergonomic and suitable for most people, you can try to adjust the position to fit the height,relax your body and have a great night. 🛌【Skin-friendly &Detachable Pillowcases】Our Skin-friendly patented pillowcase is made of comfortable soft 100% polyester and mesh sides.It can easily transfers the heat throughout the pillow over night to keep the surface nice and cool. The zipper can hides under the pillow.you can removable for machine-washing to keep clean.NOTE: THE MEMORY FOAM SHOULD NEVER BE LAUNDERED. 🧸【Excellent Choice for Gifts】This neck support pillow choose better material to provide a better sleep experience.With a great paper gift box,you can use it as the best gift for your family,friends or yourself.This is very helpful for improving sleep quality.I think you should choose the best pillow. 🎁【100% Satisfaction Guaranteed】Joherad side sleeper pillow provides a good solution for pain relief sleeping.You can try to choose our products with confidence and it will give your family a better sleep experience.When you receive this pillow,please leave it for 24 hours to let it recover its shape and elasticity before using it. 💝💝NOTICE：this cervical pillow is not a medical product. if you want to use it for medical rehabilitation, please ask your doctor.💝💝If you have any question,please contect us and get the best solution.Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gkSzNXscL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joherad","source_asin":"B0B5TQHXD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TQHXD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TQHXD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
