window.products.push({"id":1108737,"name":"Guohaoi Heated Blanket Electric Throw,10 Heating Levels Fast Heating,1/2/4/6/8 Hour Auto Off,Faux Rabbit Fur/Sherpa Heater Blanket Over-Heated Protect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rEL96KCAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM MATERIAL】: 380gsm Faux Rabbit Fur + 220gsm sherpa.The fabric is extra soft,breathable,warmer than normal blankets even without electricity. The blanket is Oeko-Tex Certified and Eco-friendly. The fabric is durable and does not shed. Heating wire is designed by high Japanese technology，bigger heating area ，stable in heating temperature, guaranteed energy saving. The existence of the heating wire is hardly felt during use,which is more comfortable. 【SAFETY】: Guohaoi Heated blankets have passed the American safety UL964 Test.Have ETL Certification.Lower Electro Magnetic Radiation.The heating wire is designed and produced by Japanese company,more advanced technology,stronger insulation and flame resistance.Moreover,the heated blanket use NTC overheating protection technology to ensure that it will not overheat and cause burning. 【ENERGY SAVING】: Guohaoi heated blanket use the intelligent temperature adjustment technology.When the temperature rises,the heated blanket will automatically adjust the temperature according to the surrounding environment,which can always provide users with a comfortable feeling and is conducive to energy saving.Compared with air conditioner,using Guohaoi heated blanket is more energy efficient,and you can save more heating costs in winter. 【EASY TO USE】: Guohaoi heated blanket have 10 heat levels,1/2/4/6/8hours auto shut off.Temperature range is 86-122°F.Controller has LCD display and three buttons to control temperature and auto shut off time,very convenient to use,even the elderly,the sick,and the disabled can use it easily.Power Cord is 8.5 feet,this long cord makes the use of the blanket more flexible,can be used on the bed,on the sofa,can be used in the study and office,very convenient. 【LARGER HEATING AREA】: The heating wire used in the Guohaoi electric blanket is longer, so the heating area is larger and the heat distribution is more uniform. 【BEST GIFT】: Guohaoi heated Blanket is the best gift for birthday or other holiday like Christmas,New Year's Day. And the use of electric blankets is good for relieving muscle soreness and joint pain, it is a great gift for the elderly, patients, and people recovering from surgery. 【5-YEAR WARRANTY】: If you encounter any quality problems within 5 years, you can contact us at any time. We have a 7x24-hour online customer service who can reply to your questions at any time. Heated blankets can be machine washed, but please read the instructions carefully before cleaning to avoid improper operation, which can avoid safety problems and prolong the service life of electric blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rEL96KCAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guohaoi","source_asin":"B0B74F276H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B74F276H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B74F276H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108738,"name":"Calphalon Commercial Hard-Anodized 12-Inch Omelette Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SB8ZS8Z7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Discontinued, no longer available from Calphalon. Amazon.com Calphalon commercial hard-anodized pans are made for the serious cook who's looking for kitchenware built to last a lifetime. For example, since eggs are cooked quickly on medium-high heat, this 12-inch omelet pan is ultrathick along the bottom and sides to absorb the higher heat levels, while protecting delicate eggs from burning. The sides are sloped to facilitate swirling the pan--gently glide the omelet around and out of the pan and onto the plate, just like a fancy restaurant. The curved cast stainless-steel handle is easy to grip and stay cooler than expected, thanks to V-shaped splits where they meet the pan. The nonporous and nonreactive hard-anodized surface resists sticking and doesn't affect the flavor or color of food. It's also tough enough to handle stainless-steel utensils and vigorous whisking. Unlike pans with plastic or wood handles, the extremely sturdy all-metal construction provides the flexibility to take the pan to the oven to keep food warm until it's ready to serve. Remember to hand wash all Calphalon pans--dishwasher detergents are bad for the finish, and their use voids the lifetime warranty. --Dale Steinke","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SB8ZS8Z7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00004SY77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SY77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SY77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
