window.products.push({"id":1108742,"name":"3D Skull Ice Mold Tray - Flexible Silicone Ice Cubes Maker with Lids for Whiskey, Cocktails, Vodka and Juice Beverages, Reusable and BPA Free, Makes 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nKMbPUwGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"6 IN 1 SKULL ICE MOLD: Package contains 1 x 6 skull shaped ice mold and 1 x funnel; It is fantastic to be used in parties, bars, restaurants, beaches, holiday events and gifts. FOOD-GRADE, DURABLE AND NON-STICK SILICONE: The flexible silicone are BPA Free and Non-Toxic, Microwave safe, Oven safe, Dishwasher safe; Standing a wide temperature range from -40℉~450℉; This durable and Non-stick silicone ice tray won't crack or break like plastic ice tray, Ice slides out of molds easily, leaving you with highly realistic-looking skull ice cubes. SLOWLY MELTING, LONG-LASTING COOLING: The slowly melting ice skulls will not dilute your drink, allowing you a more flavorful drink experience; Preserving the taste and the strength of your favorite scotch, irish whiskey, bourbon, chilling cocktails, rum, tequila and non-alcoholic drinks. MULTI-PURPOSE: The ice mold is perfect for the whisky, cocktail, iced tea, cold brew coffee, soda, lemonade, punch, water and more; You can also use the ice tray to make pretty ice spheres from colorful fruit juice, alcohol infusions, or add edible flowers, lemon slices or lime wedges to the water; In addition, the silicone mold can also be used as mousse mold, sugar mold, jelly, candy, chocolate, ice cream, soap making tools. QUALITY AFTER-SALES SERVICE: We offer a full refund or replacement if you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase. We have many other silicone ice molds and we stand by the quality of them, We can't wait to add you to our long list of happy & refreshed customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nKMbPUwGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QAAQS","source_asin":"B0831RX24L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0831RX24L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0831RX24L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
