window.products.push({"id":1108848,"name":"MAGMA Products, A10-362-IND 7 Piece Induction Cook-Top Gourmet Nesting Stainless Steel Cookware Set, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":157.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-VFgYKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The quality and value you've come to expect from Magma's current 18-10 stainless steel cookware sets now available in a 7 piece starter set. This nesting cookware stores in less than 1/2 cubic foot of cabinet space. All pots feature sealed triple clad bottoms; triple clad is a base layer of Stainless Steel, an Aluminum center section and a seamless Stainless Steel outer layer. Each bottom is then milled perfectly flat for superb even heat distribution on gas, electric, or ceramic cook top surfaces. With benefits of being oven safe, dish washer friendly and the option of adding to your set by purchasing additional individual pieces, this set is a must have. Professional quality cookware at a value price for boaters, outdoorsman, or RV enthusiasts just getting started or for the seasoned pro who expects only the best.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-VFgYKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAGMA","source_asin":"B00B99RJHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B99RJHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B99RJHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
