window.products.push({"id":1108851,"name":"Touchstone`s Forge 21 inch Freestanding Electric Stove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FryftnfML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Touchstone's Forge is the perfect for that room in your home where you want the appeal of a classic fireplace/stove, without the mess. This 21.5 inch tall free-standing electric fireplace is ideal for smaller living rooms, basements and bedrooms, which could use a little extra heat and the glow of a fireplace. The Forge has the look of a old fashioned wood-burning stove. The Forge can be used without the heating feature to add to the look of any room, but for when you need some heart it offers 2 levels of heating (high and low) to heat any room up to 400 square feet. Additionally, Touchstone’s Forge Electric Fireplace requires just a simple outlet to plug it in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FryftnfML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Touchstone","source_asin":"B00R091LZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R091LZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R091LZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108852,"name":"Blendtec Designer Series Blender, FourSide Jar - Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510gwowhG8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Blendtec Designer Series Blender Blendtec is pleased to introduce the Designer Series blender. It has been engineered to bring a whole new level of beauty and functionality to the high-end blender category, without compromising the famous power and efficiency of our Total Blender Classic. ANATOMY OF BLENDTEC DESIGNER SERIES BLENDERS DURABILITY   •   PERFORMANCE DIRECT-DRIVE POWER That metal thing on your blender base that spins the blade? That’s a socket. Machined for a precision fit with the motor shaft, it efficiently transfers power to the blade. This steel-on-steel attachment results in lower vibration, reduced noise and increased reliability. THE RIGHT BEARINGS Many blenders avoid using ball bearings to drive down cost. Blendtec uses custom designed carbon-steel sealed ball bearings. This reduces friction, diminishes noise and increases the life of the motor. PERFORMANCE  •   DURABILITY COOLER HEADS PREVAIL Your Blendtec is engineered to keep itself cool. But in the unlikely event the motor does start to heat up too much, its computer brain will shut down the machine until it cools. Keeping it safe, sound and ready to blend your next masterpiece. SELF-ADJUSTING SPEED Certain ingredients blend better at slower speeds. A Blendtec blender carefully monitors and adjusts its power to deliver the speed you want. And if you manage to stop the blade, your Blendtec blender will shut down – protecting your valuable investment. DURABILITY   •   PERFORMANCE STAINLESS STEEL – THE PROFESSIONAL’S CHOICE Blendtec’s ultra-hard stainless steel blades are cold-forged and tuned for heavy use. is allows them to be stronger and resist corrosion much better than lesser blades. SINGLE BLADE, MANY ADVANTAGES Blendtec’s patented vertical wingtips and precision angles are engineered for ultimate efficiency. The distinct single-blade design allows your ingredients to fall easily in front of the blades. DURABILITY   •   SAFETY POWER FOR THE PEOPLE The most powerful motor available for home blenders is at the heart of your Blendtec experience. More power means easier blending of the most stubborn ingredients. SAFETY MATTERS Be assured that even a blender as powerful as a Blendtec blender is ETL certified, which means it meets national safety standards. DESIGN   •   SIMPLICITY TALK TO ME The digital display tells you just how long to wait until your blend is done. It also keeps track of your usage. As you reach 99…999…9,999 blend cycles and beyond, you’ll know that you chose the right blender! PERFORMANCE   •   DURABILITY   •   SAFETY NO DETAIL TOO SMALL Even the smallest parts in a Blendtec product have received big attention from our engineers. DESIGN   •   PERFORMANCE BETTER AIRFLOW, LONGER LIFE The blender housing creates the most efficient, effective airflow possible.* Drawing cool air first through the electronics and then through the motor, the airflow design keeps things cool and extends the life of your blender. STICK-TO-ITIVENESS A unique rubber foot* helps your blender stay put. It also prevents outgoing hot air from mixing with incoming cool air, further reducing operating temperature and increasing the life of your blender. SIMPLICITY KEEPING THINGS IN PLACE Every Blendtec jar features a square base that fits snugly over the square blending platform, creating a large stable base that prevents the jar from moving or rotating. All Blendtec consumer jars work perfectly with all Blendtec consumer blenders. Mix and match to your heart's desire! SIMPLICITY GET YOUR CONTROL FREAK ON A capacitive touch control* slider makes your blender perform to your every whim. A single touch shifts the motor to the precise speed you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510gwowhG8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blendtec","source_asin":"B008TQ78CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TQ78CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TQ78CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108853,"name":"Toasters 2 Slice Best Rated Prime 2 Slice Toaster Wide Slot Compact Black Toaster with 7 Shade Bread Control Bagel/Defrost/Cancel Function Removable C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CxAjvjjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making crispy delicious breakfast become easier and efficient now with Pipigo 2 slice toaster. A kitchen essential, Toasters 2 Slice Best Rated Prime, with a silver & black appearance, has a attractive terse style applies to kinds of places. The 2 slice toaster turns any bread into a toasty treat, all at your convenience. It boasts extra-wide, self-centering slots that fit mnay kinds of breads and bagels. One-touch cancel, bagel, and defrost buttons simplify operation, and the shade selection knob with 7 levels gives you control to make toast your way, also accommodates the hasty morning routines. ✦ 2 SLICE TOASTERS SPECIFICATION: Product name: 2 slice bagel toasters Material: modern and high grade stainless steel & plastic Color: black & silver Slots size: L5.4'' X W1.5'' X H5.4'' Three function：Bagel/Defrost/Cancel ✦ BLACK TOASTERS 2 SLICE PRIME RATED PACKAGE LIST: -1*Toaster 2 Slice with box -1*2 Slice Toaster User Manual ✦ 2 SLICE TOASTERS WITE SLOTS NOTE: -For the customer favor, the \"Bagel\" button can toast bread both side while the traditional \"Bagel\" can only toast one side. -It is best not to adjust the level of 7 bread shape during using other toaster 2 slice process, otherwise, the bread will easily become darker. -Different levels have different degrees of crispness. If you want to get your favor tastes, the best solution is trying the 2-4 level toasted from beginning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CxAjvjjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pipigo","source_asin":"B083RSV7M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083RSV7M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083RSV7M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
