window.products.push({"id":1108863,"name":"Instantaneous Digital BBQ Reading Meat, Food,Candy Thermometer/Probe Water-Resistant New Super Accurate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vOvXTo7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having trouble getting an accurate reading of your foods temperature when using your old worn out thermometer? Holidays coming up Tired of having to wait longer than necessary to find out what the actual temperature of your food is? If so, you’re not alone. Its very easy to misread those old food thermometers which in turn end up giving you an overdone or underdone meal. The good news is you don't have to live with it! All it takes is a little update in technology to get your food cooking at a perfect temperature every time! This is why we at GLDev bring you the perfect digital cooking thermometer, to give you that techy edge you need to cook the perfect meal! Our thermometers are fully equipped with an LED display which includes a button allowing you to activate or deactivate a blue backlight. This display is able to show you your foods temperature 4 seconds after insertion! Tired of having to be extra careful around liquid with older digital thermometers? GUARANTEE INCLUDED if you don't like return it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vOvXTo7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global One Development Meat Thermometer","source_asin":"B07HBB1YVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HBB1YVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HBB1YVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1108864,"name":"Mr Sweets Peslak Coat of Arms, Family Crest 8.5x11 Print - Surname Origin: Polish Poland","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fZBp9G-qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The images used are EXAMPLES of what the product(s) will look like. This COLLECTIBLE product is a 8.5x11 print. The Surname for this product is the first word(s) in the products title and the country of origin is indicated with the last three words in the product title. This print uses the earliest coat of arms associated with a bearer of the surname (last name) and the time tested Surname etymology, a history of the name and its origins throughout the ages. There may be different variations of Coat of Arms for each surname and the one we use is the oldest registered Coat of Arms verified in history. History of Heraldry: Heraldry, in its broad meaning, traditionally had to do with the functions of a herald. Heraldry arose almost spontaneously in Medieval Europe around the 12th Century, coinciding with the development of armor, and the time of the crusades. This resulted in distinctive insignia's being painted on the knight's shield and embroidered on his surcoat, which was the only means by which the warrior could be identified. The Perfect Gift: These prints look great framed and/or with matting! This product ships directly from the manufacturer so please contact us with any questions you may have prior to your purchase as changes after purchase are not possible. Can't find your name? Contact us along with the name you are interested in purchasing. Due to the nature of this product returns or exchanges are only granted if the product was damaged in transit. This print is just the Coat of Arms. Make sure to check out the variations abailable as well! If you would like the surname and coat of arm history then consider the available varitions. Included in the other variations is the description of what the Coat of Arms stands for as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fZBp9G-qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr Sweets","source_asin":"B08D8NJH32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D8NJH32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D8NJH32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
