window.products.push({"id":1108962,"name":"COTA Global Dolphin Stone Snow Globe - Sparkly Water Globe Figurine with Sparkling Glitter, Collectible Novelty Ornament for Home Decor, for Birthdays","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fm3cMUvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE DOLPHIN SNOW GLOBE COMES WITH A UNIQUE DESIGN YOU LOVE – Show your love for cute dolphins with a sparkly fun Dolphin tabletop decor. The ocean animal snow globe figurine is shaped in beach theme design with waves and dolphins on the base and inside the water globe. Shake the globe to see the sparkly snow confetti fall on top the dolphin and enjoy the show! Our hand painted Dolphin Globe is a unique novelty collectible home decor. THE DECORATIVE SNOW GLOBE IS FOR ANYONE WHO LOVES OCEAN ANIMALS – A sculptured Stone Dolphin shape glitter globe for snowglobe collectors to add to their novelty collection. Families will be entertained by the beautiful glitters that fall on the dolphins inside the water globe like colorful sparkling snows. Teens and adults alike will love the unique snowglobe decoration and will surely take turns in shaking the dolphin snow globe! INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF UNIQUE SNOW GLOBE CENTERPIECE FIGURINE - Includes 1 CoTa Global Dolphin Stone Snow Globe, beautifully crafted with dolphins figure in a snow globe attached to a beach theme figurine. Features colorful sparkling glitters that look like magical snow falling down on the little dolphins inside the globe. The collectible dolphin figure snowglobe measures 3.55Lx3.55Wx3.75H inches, perfect accent on any tabletop. HIGH-QUALITY DOLPHIN SNOW GLOBE - The Dolphin stone snow globe glitter dome is made with strong and sturdy materials so you can shake the snowglobe every time you want to see the sparkly glitter fall. The clear liquid dome filled with colorful glitter is made with glass and the realistic hand-painted figurines are made with high-quality resin materials. Preserve the beauty of this ocean animal snow globe by wiping it with a damp cloth. IDEAL USE FOR DOLPHIN SNOW GLOBE CENTERPIECE - The beautiful Dolphin Stone Snow Globe Figurine can be used as tabletop decor for a living room coffee table, or as a fun accent piece on a shelf, and kitchen counter. The cute design of the dolphin figurine with snow globe would look perfect in a beach themed bedroom and anyone can play with the cute room decor! Perfect gift for Birthdays, Christmas, or Valentine's Day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fm3cMUvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B011JG6VC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1108962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011JG6VC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011JG6VC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
